<!--
     SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
     Copyright 2026 The DiamaneOS Project

     Installed as /product/etc/fonts_customization.xml, which Android reads
     with /product/fonts/ as the font directory (SystemFonts,
     FontCustomizationParser). It makes Sofia Sans Tally, the metric-adjusted
     Sofia Sans (tools/build_tally_fonts.py), the system font:

     - sans-serif, Android's default family, is Sofia Sans Tally. A named
       family defined here replaces the system one of the same name
       (FontListParser.readFamilies), so every text drawn in the default
       font, in sans-serif or in one of its aliases (sans-serif-medium,
       -light, -thin, -black, arial, helvetica, tahoma, verdana) takes it.
       Roboto stays the first fallback family, so characters Sofia Sans
       lacks (Vietnamese, Kazakh, Azerbaijani's schwa, Esperanto, some
       currency signs) are still drawn, in Roboto at the same x-height.
       sans-serif-condensed, serif and monospace stay stock.
     - sofia-sans and sofia-sans-semi-condensed, the names the Tally token
       library uses, are the same fonts, so Tally's type roles take their
       nominal sp without a size step of their own.

     Each family is one variable font per slant with a wght axis from 1 to
     1000 and 400 as its default instance. No wght axis value is fixed here, so
     text gets exactly the weight it asks for: 280, 380, 400, 500, 560, 600 in
     the Tally type roles, and these plus 300 with Bold text. Each font's
     weight is its default instance, the one drawn when 400 is asked for.
     Android reads this file together with the system font list: a malformed
     file makes it drop every system font or fail at boot, so check a change
     with `diamaneos fonts check` (DiamaneOS tools) before it ships.
-->
<fonts-modification version="1">
    <family customizationType="new-named-family" name="sans-serif">
        <font weight="400" style="normal" supportedAxes="wght" postScriptName="SofiaSansTally-Regular">SofiaSansTally-Regular.ttf</font>
        <font weight="400" style="italic" supportedAxes="wght" postScriptName="SofiaSansTally-Italic">SofiaSansTally-Italic.ttf</font>
    </family>
    <family customizationType="new-named-family" name="sofia-sans">
        <font weight="400" style="normal" supportedAxes="wght" postScriptName="SofiaSansTally-Regular">SofiaSansTally-Regular.ttf</font>
        <font weight="400" style="italic" supportedAxes="wght" postScriptName="SofiaSansTally-Italic">SofiaSansTally-Italic.ttf</font>
    </family>
    <family customizationType="new-named-family" name="sofia-sans-semi-condensed">
        <font weight="400" style="normal" supportedAxes="wght" postScriptName="SofiaSansTallySemiCondensed-Regular">SofiaSansTallySemiCondensed-Regular.ttf</font>
        <font weight="400" style="italic" supportedAxes="wght" postScriptName="SofiaSansTallySemiCondensed-Italic">SofiaSansTallySemiCondensed-Italic.ttf</font>
    </family>
</fonts-modification>
